Shriekers summon a random monster 10% of the time per shriek.  If they
do summon a monster, there is a 1/11 chance that it is a purple worm.  
If a shrieker is awake, it will shriek regardless of whether you're hitting it.

Being XL1 or XL5 does not matter in this case.  Note that the summoned
monster will not appear in your field of view, so shriekers are very
subtle in a way.

